## Why This Is Asked

Tests practical skills in optimizing real frontend pipelines: Lighthouse metrics, code splitting, and bundle analysis, all at the beginner level but with tangible impact.

## Key Concepts

- Lighthouse metrics (TTI, FCP, TBT) and thresholds for beginners
- Route-based code splitting and dynamic imports
- React.lazy, Suspense, and skeleton fallbacks
